# An agent commits with no green verification, and `le commit push` refuses,
# naming the verify that clears it; once a green full verification covers HEAD,
# the push-only script is prepared.
#
# The fixture builds a throwaway Ze checkout with a bare upstream (ZE_REPO_ROOT)
# and drives the REAL `le commit push`. The green record stands in for the
# verification, whose own leg is verify-green-record-clears-derived-debt.ci.
# It asserts the script makes no commit, re-derives with
# `debt-status commit <P>`, and pushes `<P>:refs/heads/main`.
#
# Spec: spec-verification-debt-derived (closed; design in docs/architecture/testing/verify-freshness-scope.md) (AC-3).
# Make deriveDebt (internal/le/commit/owed.go) answer pushTargetHead with no
# green record and seq=1 fails at push-refused-without-green.

option=timeout:value=60s

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=le test fixture runner/commit-push-refused-by-derived-debt
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=push-refused-without-green
expect=stdout:contains=push-script-prepared-for-head
